{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565070/extras/logo_steam_opis.png?t=1745522462\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Cybernoir \u2013 Dive into the Dark Heart of Nova City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The year is 2053.</strong> Nova City, a neon-lit metropolis drowning in corruption, is a place where the line between law and chaos has long since vanished. Step into the shoes of <strong>Mike Crow</strong>, a private detective with a troubled past, as he stumbles upon a murder case that could shake the city to its core. Corporate conspiracies, gang wars, and corrupt politicians\u2014everyone has something to hide, and your choices will shape the fate of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565070/extras/Desktop_Screenshot_2025.03.02_-_03.14.43.05_kopia.png?t=1745522462\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Detective Story with Non-Linear Choices</strong> \u2013 Your decisions impact the story and character relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> \u2013 Engage in intense gunfights, take cover, and fight enemies in brutal melee combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565070/extras/gif1.gif?t=1745522462\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Open World Nova City</strong> \u2013 Explore a city full of hidden locations, side missions, and secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hacking and Infiltration</strong> \u2013 Break into corporate systems and uncover classified information. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Investigations and Evidence Gathering</strong> \u2013 Use your detective skills to solve a murder and uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565070/extras/gif3.gif?t=1745522462\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark Neo-Noir Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Rain-soaked streets, glowing neon, and danger lurking in every shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Moral Choices</strong> \u2013 Will you uphold justice, or sell your soul to the highest bidder?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565070/extras/gif2.gif?t=1745522462\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you survive in a world where everyone has a price?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the brutal reality of Nova City and become a legend\u2026 or just another forgotten ghost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565070?t=1745522462","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565070?t=1745522462","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565070/cb715756422d0e4da92df9391ab84784d5895d04/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745522462","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565070/cb715756422d0e4da92df9391ab84784d5895d04/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745522462","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Cybernoir is a game set in a dark cyberpunk world that explores th